2026-07-27T07:59:31.2230934Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:59:31.2231874Z i /tmp/RtmpO3PbUt/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:59:31.2232258Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:59:31.2232715Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:59:31.2233276Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:59:31.2233921Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:59:31.2234873Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:59:31.2235925Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
