2026-07-27T07:59:31.2619566Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:59:31.3076420Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:59:31.3249014Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
